---
import DetailHeading from '../detailHeading.astro';
---
<div class="space-y-6 text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
  <section>
    <DetailHeading>Product surface</DetailHeading>
    <p class="mt-4">
      StrefaSA combines a public Astro marketing frontend for an MTA:SA community with a <span class="font-mono text-green-400">/sklep</span> route for the in-game store. The site is available at <a class="text-green-400 hover:underline" href="https://www.strefasa.pl" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">www.strefasa.pl</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <DetailHeading>Integration boundary</DetailHeading>
    <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
      <li><span class="font-bold text-slate-300">Astro frontend:</span> owns the public presentation and the store entry point.</li>
      <li><span class="font-bold text-slate-300">Separate backend:</span> the shop hands the payment flow to the MTA backend instead of keeping fulfillment in the marketing frontend.</li>
      <li><span class="font-bold text-slate-300">Stripe Checkout:</span> provides the payment step used by the store integration.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section>
    <DetailHeading>Scope boundary</DetailHeading>
    <p class="mt-4">
      The frontend repository and payment backend are private. The public result is verified through the live site and the documented route and integration boundary; no conversion or revenue claim is made here.
    </p>
  </section>
</div>
